import{_ as t,o as n,c as i,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 403 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Retcon-Ending Analysis: Late-Setting Overturn and the Linkage Contradiction with Swallowing Starry Sky","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 403 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Retcon-Ending Analysis: Late-Setting Overturn and the Linkage Contradiction with Swallowing Starry Sky","no":403,"module":2,"tags":["Manghuang Ji","Ji Ning","Retcon Ending","Swallowing Starry Sky","Multi-Book Linkage"],"related":["97-Setting-Contradiction Self-Check Table","99-Document Version and Maintenance Note","09-Reality-as-Foundation Fundamental Stance"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0403_模块2-莽荒纪-吃书烂尾分析-后期设定推翻与吞噬星空联动矛盾.md","filePath":"en/0403_模块2-莽荒纪-吃书烂尾分析-后期设定推翻与吞噬星空联动矛盾.md"}'),a={name:"en/0403_模块2-莽荒纪-吃书烂尾分析-后期设定推翻与吞噬星空联动矛盾.md"};function s(r,e,l,g,d,c){return n(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-403-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-retcon-ending-analysis-late-setting-overturn-and-the-linkage-contradiction-with-swallowing-starry-sky" tabindex="-1">Entry 403 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Retcon-Ending Analysis: Late-Setting Overturn and the Linkage Contradiction with Swallowing Starry Sky <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-403-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-retcon-ending-analysis-late-setting-overturn-and-the-linkage-contradiction-with-swallowing-starry-sky" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 403 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Retcon-Ending Analysis: Late-Setting Overturn and the Linkage Contradiction with Swallowing Starry Sky&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Manghuang Ji Full Decomposition (Entry 8) | Benchmark base: Documents 97, 99, 09</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-two-novels-share-one-cosmos-setting-becomes-mutual-sabotage" tabindex="-1">Introduction: when two novels share one cosmos, setting becomes mutual sabotage <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-two-novels-share-one-cosmos-setting-becomes-mutual-sabotage" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: when two novels share one cosmos, setting becomes mutual sabotage&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the <strong>law-first axiom</strong> here is almost a &quot;truth-revealing mirror&quot; — never retcon, never end in collapse, setting self-consistency above plot convenience. Both Manghuang Ji and <em>Swallowing Starry Sky</em> are I-Eat-Tomatoes works; late they are forcibly compiled into one cosmos model, so two separately valid early settings crash into each other in linkage: cosmos model, spacetime rules, strong-one tiers rewritten repeatedly. Protagonist uniqueness dependency = high-leaning-medium. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judging base has been upgraded to the six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Retcon itself is the greatest energy waste: to make a new setting cohere, the author must tear down the early carefully laid worldview and retell it; readers to follow the new setting must repeatedly overturn old understandings. Ji Ning&#39;s Controller position, after two-book linkage, its &quot;Controller&quot; weight is also redefined — the early-established &quot;cosmos peak&quot; cognition late proves to be only a local corner in some larger cosmos. <strong>All early worldview trust is depreciated in one go during linkage.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>How linkage retcon manufactures regression feeling:</p><ol><li><strong>Cosmos boundary redrawn</strong>: Manghuang&#39;s &quot;cosmos&quot; after linkage shrinks to a corner in a larger model; all early &quot;cosmos-tier&quot; descriptions devalued</li><li><strong>Rules mutually exclusive</strong>: Manghuang&#39;s law system and Swallowing Starry Sky&#39;s cultivation system (Martial-Artist — Thought-Form — Starry-Sky tier) originally incompatible; forced merger makes rules fuzzy</li><li><strong>Foreshadowing abandoned</strong>: many foreshadowings Manghuang early laid are shelved or rewritten for linkage needs; readers&#39; expectations systematically dashed</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Behind retcon is the author-level monopoly of &quot;setting interpretive right&quot;:</p><ul><li><strong>Setting serves business</strong>: multi-book linkage is essentially IP operation; to continue popularity does not hesitate to overturn early setting</li><li><strong>Protagonist always right</strong>: Ji Ning in the new cosmos after linkage is still a strong one; early supporting characters&#39; fates are casually rewritten to fit the new main line</li><li><strong>Readers treated as tools</strong>: readers&#39; emotional investment in old setting is treated by the author as consumable stock — this is another kind of &quot;stock predation&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Manghuang Linkage Retcon</th><th>Heng Yuan Zhou Setting Engineering</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Multi-book forced merger, rules mutually exclusive</td><td>Document version and maintenance note: all setting versions traceable, not overturned</td></tr><tr><td>Early foreshadowing casually rewritten</td><td>Setting-contradiction self-check table: any new setting first passes self-consistency check</td></tr><tr><td>Cosmos boundary redrawn with plot</td><td>Plane theory and classification: plane classification legislated first, expansion via appendix caliber</td></tr><tr><td>Old-setting trust depreciated</td><td>Law-first: new dimensions joined incrementally, never overturning old setting</td></tr><tr><td>Sacrifice self-consistency for popularity</td><td>Reality-as-foundation: setting serves logic, not sequel business</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Manghuang&#39;s early setting and post-linkage late setting&#39;s &quot;rule-conflict matrix&quot;</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: compare &quot;forced merger,&quot; &quot;independent cosmoses each ended,&quot; &quot;Anchor version-management injected&quot; three linkage modes</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: early foreshadowing survival rate, setting-conflict-point count, reader trust</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: quantified conclusion — under forced merger, foreshadowing survival lowest, conflict points most; version management lets multi-book share a framework without mutual sabotage</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: low</strong>. The two works&#39; law systems are mutually exclusive; after linkage cannot both hold</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: extreme</strong>. Multi-book linkage is web-literature&#39;s retcon disaster area; Manghuang and Swallowing Starry Sky&#39;s cosmos model to this day has no recognized self-consistent explanation</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: high-leaning-medium</strong>. After linkage Ji Ning&#39;s &quot;peak&quot; status relies on the author&#39;s redefinition, not law guarantee</li></ul><p>Linkage retcon also has a hidden cost: it puts single-work old readers in an awkward position. Manghuang readers spent over a million characters building a cosmology, only to be notified after Swallowing Starry Sky linkage that the cosmos they thought was just a bubble. This kind of disrespect for old readers is essentially treating existing readers as consumable business assets. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s version management goes the opposite direction — every bit of old readers&#39; trust is non-depreciable asset; new setting can only join incrementally, must never go back to deny every word they have read.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: early worldview trust depreciated in one linkage</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: readers&#39; emotional investment treated as consumable stock</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo system at least self-contained as one realm, not merged with others; Manghuang&#39;s retcon is &quot;cross-work tier&quot;</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: after linkage Myriad Ranks&#39; position in the larger cosmos is even more chaotic</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: looks like cross-work expansion, but actually crashes each cross; the opposite of &quot;infinitely expandable without collapse&quot;</li></ul><p>Retcon-ending also has a scoring dimension: do readers still believe. Manghuang late, when readers have learned &quot;anyway it&#39;ll change later,&quot; any early-established rule loses binding force — readers no longer use rules to predict plot, but use &quot;protagonist halo.&quot; This equals the author personally scrapping his own rule system. The reason Heng Yuan Zhou places the law-first axiom last among five axioms yet makes it this entry&#39;s core is precisely that once the rule system loses credit, the whole work&#39;s worldview collapses by half.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Multi-book linkage is not the original sin; the original sin is doing linkage without version management or self-consistency check. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s approach is plain: new dimensions all via appendix, old setting not one character changed. Manghuang and Swallowing Starry Sky&#39;s crash tells us — the bigger the worldview wants to be, the more must first nail &quot;rules must not be casually overturned,&quot; otherwise the bigger the messier.</p><p>In the final analysis, Manghuang Ji · retcon-ending analysis · late-setting overturn and the linkage contradiction with Swallowing Starry Sky described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./402_模块2-莽荒纪-境界膨胀批判-十六层境界的设定崩坏.html">Entry 402 · Realm-Inflation Critique</a> · <a href="./430_模块2-莽荒纪-吞噬星空联动-两部曲的设定矛盾与吃书.html">Entry 430 · Swallowing Starry Sky Linkage</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/97-设定矛盾自查表.html">97-Setting-Contradiction Self-Check Table</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const m=t(a,[["render",s]]);export{u as __pageData,m as default};
